Dear Faye,

=20

Please could you explain what you wrote below about the Brooklyn apartments=
?

=20

Are you saying after all the back-and-forth of correspondence in November, =
December, January and February we will not have an appraisal because the res=
pondent dragged the process?

=20

I vigorously oppose this because the respondent=E2=80=99s dragging is tactical. I=
t is in his favour, and it is against my best interest.

=20

Also, there is not a chance in the world I will accept to do any exchange o=
f real estate based on valuations of 11 September 2020.

=20

Lastly, I reserve the right for a full audit of the accounts, rental revenu=
es and payments made to Sal Gargano throughout the proceedings as I have pro=
vided documentary evidence of widespread dissipation of the rental revenues.

=20

I will be taking appropriate action in New York against the respondent and =
Sal Gargano and am copying Brent here to make sure that nothing in the Final=
 Court Orders stops me from pursuing such actions in the US.

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

=20

=20

